   "lines": [
    "Went in town;",
    "called on poor",
    "Cassin[?]. In evening",
    "came out here to",
    "the Dickeys; I like",
    "them ever so much,",
    "they are so sweet",
    "and homelike.",
    "Honest old Charles",
    "Dickey is coming",
    "to Harvard next",
    "year, and I shall",
    "do the best I",
    "can for him."
   ],
